values ('bbbb0005-0000-4000-8000-000000000016', 'en', null, 'Japanese Culture & Civilization', 'A guided tour of Japan from its islands and ancient history to Shinto and Buddhism, its language and literature, its traditional and performing arts, and its modern global reach. The structure and facts are adapted from the open article on the Culture of Japan published by Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia (CC BY-SA 4.0). Written as original prose for respectful, accurate study.', null, 'foundations', 68, true, 'humanities', '{}')
